# keybound-whisper vocabulary
#
# One term per line. These are fed to the model as an initial prompt, which
# biases decoding toward them. Use it for words the model has no reason to
# expect: product names, people, libraries, jargon.
#
# This is a nudge, not a guarantee. When a word comes out acoustically far from
# what you wanted, fix it in `replacements` instead.
#
# Copy to ~/.config/keybound-whisper/vocabulary and edit.

arm64
Kubernetes
PostgreSQL
Hammerspoon
whisper.cpp
